    "description": "E2E test collection for daily insights routes (src/routes/insights_routes.py). Covers insight generation, pending-insight retrieval, dismiss, and action-taken, including ownership/security checks across two independent test identities. No route in this domain writes user-authored text into a crisis-detection or notification pipeline, so every request here is safe to execute live."
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://lugn-trygg-backend.onrender.com" },
    { "key": "testPassword", "value": "AuditP@ss2026x!" },
